 class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedrun timer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements<br><br>Coming soon:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenges, Highscore lists and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chubby is on another mission...<i>will you join him?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/08dcf0567e945e655bfe92371f4fa1a3.poster.avif?t=1749032322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/08dcf0567e945e655bfe92371f4fa1a3.webm?t=1749032322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/08dcf0567e945e655bfe92371f4fa1a3.mp4?t=1749032322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
